    check=dict(t='The 15 mcg/mL toxic level is not the test; the window is. The dose scales peak and trough together, so at 8 hours a trough of 2 needs a peak of 12.69, over 10; only a shorter interval moves the trough up alone, and 6 hours gives 2.5 mg/L.'),
